From: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Subject: MAINTAINERS: cover memory initialization helper headers
Date: Sun, 01 Nov 2026 18:30:41 -0800

Cover the firmware memory-map interface and read-only-data test header
under MEMBLOCK AND INITIALIZATION.  The firmware interface is shared with
MEMORY HOT(UN)PLUG, which is covered by the next patch.

Add the following file assignments:

MEMORY MANAGEMENT - MEMBLOCK AND INITIALIZATION
        include/linux/firmware-map.h
        include/linux/rodata_test.h

Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Cc: Mike Rapoport <rppt@kernel.org>
